    },
    "modules": "Verify installed modules and edition capabilities from target metadata. base/contacts/product/mrp alone does not establish availability of account models or accounting features.",
    "companies": "Seed NORTH and SOUTH, grant the exercise user the intended company access, then choose one operation company per run.",
    "selection_values": "Match human labels to each target major's captured choices; do not reuse an Odoo19 alias as a version-neutral default.",
